    "title": "2Steps: Dating App & Chat",
    "description": "2Steps - popular dating app with the EASYEST REGISTRATION. Finding new dating is easy, simple, and fast! \u2764\r\n\r\nFind romantic relationships, nice dating, flirt or serious relationships near you. Guys or girls nearby on your city map. Meet and date! \r\n\r\nDownload the app now and start a new dating or relationship! Swipe right, like, one message and your life can change nicely! Find dating near you with the 2Steps app!\r\n\r\n2Steps is EASY and FAST! Registration is very simple, with no mandatory authorization through social networks, SMS, etc. Create an account in seconds and start meeting people!\r\n\r\nADVANTAGES:\r\n\u2714 2Steps is a safe and free mobile dating and social app.\r\n\u2714 Find out who likes you for free! You don't have to buy a PREMIUM to know who likes you, like other dating apps.\r\n\u2714 Quick signup. Sign up in seconds WITHOUT having to connect to social networks or phone. Or log in the best way you can via Google, Facebook. Start making friends in seconds!\r\n\u2714 FIND PEOPLE NEAR YOU! Meet and connect with people around you who are ready to get acquainted right now. \r\n\u2714 Search for dating all over the world. Meet men and women from London, Paris, New York, Amsterdam, Rome, Paris and many other cities around the world!\r\n\u2714 Not only meet, but also chat in the 2Steps app. See which users are active and ready for new online dating. If you like each other, start chatting with the person you like and grow your relationship. \r\n\u2714 Write to any one for free, even without buying PREMIUM. Don't wait for a like in return to start chatting.\r\n\u2714 Filters help you find a potential soulmate by interest, age, gender, location and activity. Find romance, friends, flirtation, dating, love or a serious relationship. Connect only with the people your goals are aligned with!\r\n\r\n2Steps - Find your match quickly and easily!",
